   │
   ▼
Final Answer
Example: Travel Booking

User asks:

"Plan a 3-day trip to Goa."

| Agent          | Responsibility            |
| -------------- | ------------------------- |
| Planner Agent  | Creates the itinerary     |
| Flight Agent   | Finds flights             |
| Hotel Agent    | Finds hotels              |
| Weather Agent  | Checks weather            |
| Budget Agent   | Calculates expenses       |
| Reviewer Agent | Reviews the complete plan |


