Real-World Examples

| Project                     | Type        | Agents                                         |
| --------------------------- | ----------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| Restaurant Ordering Chatbot | Two-Agent   | Order Agent, Menu Agent                        |
| PDF Question Answering      | Two-Agent   | Retrieve Agent, Assistant Agent                |
| Travel Planner              | Multi-Agent | Planner, Flight, Hotel, Budget, Weather        |
| Customer Support System     | Multi-Agent | Support, Billing, Technical, Escalation        |
| Healthcare Assistant        | Multi-Agent | Diagnosis, Prescription, Appointment, Pharmacy |


Advantages
Two-Agent
Easier to develop
Easier to test
Suitable for smaller projects
Good for beginners
Multi-Agent
Better task specialization
Can handle complex workflows
Easier to extend by adding new agents
Well suited for enterprise applications
