Which Should You Use?

| Scenario              | Recommendation |
| --------------------- | -------------- |
| Learning Agentic AI   | Two-Agent      |
| Restaurant Chatbot    | Two-Agent      |
| PDF Q&A (RAG)         | Two-Agent      |
| AI Coding Assistant   | Multi-Agent    |
| Travel Booking System | Multi-Agent    |
| Enterprise Automation | Multi-Agent    |


